sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant T as Trajectory::Run
participant H as GromacsFrameHandler
participant TP as TrajectoryProtein
participant P as Protein
participant C as ProteinConformation
participant OR as OperationRunner
participant TR as TrajectoryResult list
participant E as Emitters and records

T->>H: Open trajectory files
T->>H: Read frame 0
T->>TP: Seed(frame0 positions, time)
TP->>P: FinalizeConstruction
TP->>P: AddMDFrame
TP->>TP: InitTrajectoryAtoms
T->>TP: Attach RunConfiguration results
T->>T: Validate dependencies and Session resources
T->>T: Build base RunOptions
T->>E: Emit invariant sidecars if output_dir is set
T->>T: Update TrajectoryEnv and frame RunOptions
T->>TP: MutableCanonicalConformation_()
TP-->>T: frame0 conformation
T->>OR: Run(frame0 conformation, options)
OR->>C: Attach ConformationResult singletons
T->>TP: DispatchCompute(frame0, trajectory, 0, time)
TP->>TR: Compute(frame0, trajectory state)
T->>E: Emit PDB and NPY, record frame metadata

loop later dispatched frames
  T->>H: Skip stride minus one frames
  T->>H: Read next frame
  T->>T: Update TrajectoryEnv and frame RunOptions
  T->>TP: TickConformation(positions)
  TP-->>T: unique_ptr to base ProteinConformation
  T->>OR: Run(current conformation, options)
  OR->>C: Attach ConformationResult singletons
  T->>TP: DispatchCompute(current conformation, trajectory, index, time)
  TP->>TR: Compute(current conformation, trajectory state)
  T->>E: Emit PDB and NPY, record frame metadata
end

T->>TP: FinalizeAllResults(trajectory)
TP->>TR: Finalize and adopt DenseBuffers
